{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35883","headline":"同友生春夜闻雨 · 李咸用","name":"同友生春夜闻雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春雨三更洗物华，乱和丝竹响豪家。\n滴繁知在长条柳，点重愁看破朵花。\n檐静尚疑兼雾细，灯摇应是逐风斜。\n此时童叟浑无梦，爲喜流膏润谷芽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35883.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35883","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}